# Motor Comparison

{% hint style="info" %}
This page is intended to highlight the ***relative*** comparison between REV ION motors and similar motors from other vendors.&#x20;

For more information please see the section below - [Interpreting this Data](#interpreting-this-data)
{% endhint %}

## NEO Vortex - Quick Comparison

